<p>Let me first explain how to solve it. After generating our own .xcconfig file, the CocoaPods configuration is the default. We changed it to our own but didn’t manage CocoaPods, so CocoaPods’ build settings might not take effect in the project because of our changes. To solve this, we need to import CocoaPods’ xcconfig into our own xcconfig.</p>

<p><img src="/assets/images/20201004XcodeBuildXcconfigFile/xcconfig5.avif" alt="xcconfig" /></p>

<p><img src="/assets/images/20201004XcodeBuildXcconfigFile/xcconfig6.avif" alt="xcconfig" /></p>

<p>Here I also declared 2 variables in the debug and release configurations, for testing variable usage in the project below.</p>

